# The minigame instruction screen: observed up from port frame 12,600, and it
# does not take input until its entry animation finishes (`while (instMode !=
# 1)`, a few hundred frames later), so this is a short metronome inside a
# window rather than a tap at a frame.  Four presses, 256 apart, all at +32 in
# the A metronome's period so none of them shares a frame with an A.
# (dropped for --com4) at 12968 1 START
# (dropped for --com4) at 13224 1 START
# (dropped for --com4) at 13480 1 START
# (dropped for --com4) at 13736 1 START

# M25: steer controller 1 into the wall for a four-way DRAW (--mghold)
at 14700 1200 dstk:LEFT
